  "id": "coping",
  "term": "coping",
  "definition": "Coping is the mental and behavioral effort a person uses to handle situations they see as stressful or as going beyond their available resources. In this view, how stressful something feels depends partly on how the person judges the demands, their resources, and their options for responding.",
